  {/* Installation */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Installation</Heading>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Dashboard is a <strong>block</strong> — a full-page layout template you copy into your project and own. Unlike components, blocks are not imported from a package. You get the full source code and can customize it however you need.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>1. Install dependencies</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-kumo-subtle">The chart component requires <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5">echarts</code> and <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5">@cloudflare/kumo</code> alongside <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</code>.</p>
        <CodeBlock code={installCode} lang="bash" />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>2. Copy the chart component</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-kumo-subtle">The chart is a React island. Copy <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5">DashboardChart.tsx</code> into your project alongside the page.</p>
        <CodeBlock code={`# Copy DashboardChart.tsx into:
src/components/DashboardChart.tsx`} lang="bash" />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>3. Copy the source code into a new page</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`# Copy the source code above into:
src/pages/dashboard.astro`} lang="bash" />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>4. Replace the hardcoded data</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`// Swap the static stat card values, table rows, and chart data
// with your own data source (API, database, etc.)`} lang="js" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Usage */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Usage</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Drop this in as a page file (e.g. <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">src/pages/dashboard.astro</code>). The sidebar, stat cards, and table are static — replace the hardcoded data with your own. The chart uses <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">client:only="react"</code> for hydration.
    </p>
    <CodeBlock code={usageCode} lang="astro" />
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Examples */}

  <ComponentSection>
